{#
  giscus 评论区（GitHub Discussions 驱动）
  部署完成后需要填写 data-repo-id 与 data-category-id：
  1. 在仓库 Settings 开启 Discussions
  2. 打开 https://giscus.app/zh-CN 选择仓库后自动生成
  单篇文章可通过 front-matter 设置 comments: false 关闭
#}
{%- if post.comments %}
<div class="post-comments-giscus">
  <script src="https://giscus.app/client.js"
    data-repo="SIpeenys/sipeenys.github.io"
    data-repo-id=""
    data-category="General"
    data-category-id=""
    data-mapping="pathname"
    data-strict="0"
    data-reactions-enabled="1"
    data-emit-metadata="0"
    data-input-position="top"
    data-theme="transparent_dark"
    data-lang="zh-CN"
    data-loading="lazy"
    crossorigin="anonymous"
    async>
  </script>
</div>
{%- endif %}
